<!-- Template Description -->
This module implements {{T|LType2}}. It generates a logo link for various music and merchandise platforms, automatically handling URL structures and logo selection.

== Usage ==
This module is intended to be used by {{T|LType2}}

<pre>
{{#invoke:ServiceLink|link|SERVICE_ID|ITEM_ID|DESCRIPTION|BOOTH_DESC}}
</pre>

== Parameters ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description !! Example
|-
| 1 || '''Platform Name (Service ID)'''<br>The identifier for the service (e.g., amazon, spotify, booth). See the table below for supported IDs. || spotify
|-
| 2 || '''Item ID'''<br>The unique ID used in the platform's URL. || 4jKI...
|-
| 3 || '''Store Name / Description'''<br>For '''Booth''': The subdomain (store name).<br>For '''others''': An optional description appended to the link tooltip. || my-store (Booth)<br>(Deluxe Edition) (Others)
|-
| 4 || '''Booth Description'''<br>For '''Booth only''': An optional description appended to the link tooltip. || (Digital Ver.)
|}

